{
  "id": "q4ede",
  "title": "Provision PostgreSQL from VS Code",
  "published_at": "2026-06-15",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/provision-postgresql-from-vs-code-franck-pachot-q4ede",
  "author": "Franck Pachot",
  "body_html": "\n<!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">In the&nbsp;</span><span class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdev%2Eto%2Ffranckpachot%2Fhorizondb-preview-automate-a-reproducible-lab-with-arm-2515&amp;urlhash=tS2j&amp;trk=article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" target=\"_blank\" data-tracking-control-name=\"article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\" data-test-link=\"\">previous post,<!----></a></span><span class=\"\">&nbsp;I set up a HorizonDB using the Azure CLI (az). As a developer, you prefer to stay within your favorite IDE. In Visual Studio Code, with Microsoft's </span><span class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmarketplace%2Evisualstudio%2Ecom%2Fitems%3FitemName%3Dms-ossdata%2Evscode-pgsql&amp;urlhash=oG5F&amp;trk=article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" target=\"_blank\" data-tracking-control-name=\"article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\" data-test-link=\"\">PostgreSQL extension from Microsoft<!----></a></span><span class=\"\">, you can provision a PostgreSQL database:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">\n      </span></p><ul>\n        \n    <li><span class=\"\">a local PostgreSQL instance on Docker using the official community image built by the </span><span class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub%2Ecom%2Fdocker-library%2Fpostgres&amp;urlhash=gK7M&amp;trk=article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" target=\"_blank\" data-tracking-control-name=\"article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\" data-test-link=\"\">PostgreSQL docker community<!----></a></span><!----></li>\n    <li><span class=\"\">a managed PostgreSQL on Azure, also known as </span><span class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn%2Emicrosoft%2Ecom%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fpostgresql%2Foverview&amp;urlhash=3VtD&amp;trk=article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" target=\"_blank\" data-tracking-control-name=\"article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\" data-test-link=\"\">Azure Database for PostgreSQL Flexible Server<!----></a></span><span class=\"\">, provided by Microsoft</span><!----></li>\n    <li><span class=\"\">or </span><span class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn%2Emicrosoft%2Ecom%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fhorizondb%2Foverview&amp;urlhash=5fug&amp;trk=article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" target=\"_blank\" data-tracking-control-name=\"article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\" data-test-link=\"\">HorizonDB<!----></a></span><span class=\"\">—the PostgreSQL-compatible service with disaggregated storage on Azure. </span><!----></li>\n\n      </ul>\n  <!---->\n        <p></p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">When selecting HorizonDB, the extension connects directly to Azure:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQFuMRnQkKv46A/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7Hm013KoAM-/0/1781465304701?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=4xEW3Hf1Br-Q3ypiG8P61bkFZdq0weUUFhtpNQwyY8A\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">Choose your subscription, then select or create a resource group. Next, pick a region where HorizonDB Azure is available (</span><span class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn%2Emicrosoft%2Ecom%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fhorizondb%2Foverview%23azure-regions&amp;urlhash=0WBa&amp;trk=article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" target=\"_blank\" data-tracking-control-name=\"article-ssr-frontend-pulse_little-text-block\" data-tracking-will-navigate=\"\" data-test-link=\"\">HorizonDB Azure Regions<!----></a></span><span class=\"\">)  and set the PostgreSQL compatibility version (currently PG17):</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQFn69CG311Jbg/article-inline_image-shrink_1000_1488/B4EZ7HmkRsKkAI-/0/1781465236861?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=bdUQSrrjwnHIjaexUCAYZwmPFZYKYGz9DI9DL04T8cg\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">Choose the instance size and set a username and password for connection:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQGsrN_fn7YI_A/article-inline_image-shrink_1500_2232/B4EZ7HmrUDJgAQ-/0/1781465265694?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=tQijVyTfJHo4UdJN0z2i5waxgP6Fb3JOA3x_EW6IODk\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">The provisioning process takes about 15 minutes to deploy the resources:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQFe8F5_CA0UTw/article-inline_image-shrink_1500_2232/B4EZ7HoQM.IwAU-/0/1781465678926?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=XGyUIolcv6OJtwPxXd17BLysZJSxcnu1ZkRKGS5x5K0\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">A new connection has been created in the VS Code extension. You can specify the database name (e.g., postgres) and access all extension features, including object explorer, query editor, query plan visualizer, schema ERD, and performance dashboard. Your IP has been added to the firewall rules, and you can add more if needed:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQGqbng-AoZejg/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7Ho93IIwAM-/0/1781465866370?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=kzcvV-CzX5J2EeIcjDtQ6X_sT1_SOlkD2PrStJuhLBs\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">If you're provisioning a database for short-term use, remember to delete it in the Azure portal.</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    <hr data-test-id=\"publishing-divider-block\" class=\"my-[3.2rem] mx-auto h-[1px] border-0 bg-black-a16\">\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">For local development, you might prefer to run a PostgreSQL container. It still appears under \"Azure Deployments\":</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQE1sfQ6lsV3hA/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7Hr0JpHAAM-/0/1781466612742?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=CR_clilHjwggBbx2284Z7-DAxmEHXua0AJ7SE3R0NQU\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">It verifies the prerequisites, confirming that Docker Desktop is installed:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQGI68Y1LXjfTA/article-inline_image-shrink_1000_1488/B4EZ7HsUjhKEAM-/0/1781466745331?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=6HuPuvAhtx9yf-xKoFMVajx8_48viXSMv-oTMr5R-UU\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">Provide the necessary minimal information to create the container:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQHUxhoi_NA0NQ/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7HtEHKHwAM-/0/1781466940131?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=0K3edDklxHeO5OpdnF4F_hTuWY9zNYcXUG_MjJd4hus\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">The creation process begins by launching a container from the \"postgres:latest\" image and establishing a connection. </span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">The dashboard then alerts about the required settings to display all metrics and SQL statements:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQHBP-md4DU44A/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7Hw0LLJMAQ-/0/1781467923440?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=L_3RGRf7IoQCFlfnKstpktZGT5LPVhfBYsKkAlSvjig\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">In the query editor linked to the Postgres database, I activate them:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        \n    <pre class=\"my-4 mx-0 block overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded-md bg-color-background-container-dark-tint p-4 font-mono text-md font-normal leading-open text-color-text-on-dark\"><span class=\"\">ALTER SYSTEM set track_io_timing TO ON;\n\nALTER SYSTEM set track_wal_io_timing TO ON;\n\nSHOW shared_preload_libraries;\n\nALTER SYSTEM set shared_preload_libraries TO 'pg_stat_statements';\n\nCREATE EXTENSION pg_stat_statements;        </span></pre>\n  \n          </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">I restarted PostgreSQL via Docker Desktop to apply the new configuration and then loaded the pgbench schema:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        \n    <pre class=\"my-4 mx-0 block overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded-md bg-color-background-container-dark-tint p-4 font-mono text-md font-normal leading-open text-color-text-on-dark\"><span class=\"\">docker restart pg\n\ndocker exec pg pgbench -iIdtGvpf -U postgres postgres\n\ndocker exec pg pgbench -c 10 -T 300 -U postgres postgres        </span></pre>\n  \n          </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">I added foreign keys (by adding 'f' to the default initialization steps) to observe the schema visualizer:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQEvkHvarogHOQ/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7HzmtlHAAM-/0/1781468654809?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=HEC5wItb0JfQChagKnR8sZVt1x5wE55ut4R3iQ_wWBQ\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">The dashboard shows the active session timeline, from pg_stat_activity sampling:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQEuNDFIHM2LEQ/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7KPJJiKUAQ-/0/1781509428119?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=I5RG-rJ9Kg3-EhP2AYxK7BSBW9_I4BuKuPOtHmEjU9Q\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">It also displays the queries from pg_stat_statements:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQEaRtkLKdRTYA/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7KOzeLKQAM-/0/1781509339331?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=4TEmMy4FnozxrY392LTH6Gcog0aep6SjaYk-4QuJjUA\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">When connected to Copilot, it provides automatic database diagnostic monitoring:</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    \n\n    \n      <div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\" data-test-id=\"publishing-image-block\" rel=\"ugc\">\n        \n      <figure>\n        <img alt=\"Article content\" class=\"lazy-load block w-full\" data-delayed-url=\"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E12AQGqjJQxrIhkRA/article-inline_image-shrink_400_744/B4EZ7KTxeBHMAU-/0/1781510641927?e=2147483647&amp;v=beta&amp;t=0musFfQ9NSF1i3nJCDQSJlumXLCj2VqBVYIWkyIMvgc\">\n<!---->      </figure>\n    \n      </div>\n  \n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">Those are available for any PostgreSQL or PostgreSQL-compatible databases and allow quick monitoring without leaving the IDE.</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n    <hr data-test-id=\"publishing-divider-block\" class=\"my-[3.2rem] mx-auto h-[1px] border-0 bg-black-a16\">\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">With the PostgreSQL extension in Visual Studio Code, you can easily set up and connect to PostgreSQL environments—whether it's a local Docker container, Azure Flexible Server, or HorizonDB—without ever leaving your IDE. </span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!----><!---->                  \n\n    <div class=\"article-main__content\" data-test-id=\"publishing-text-block\">\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"\">Feel encouraged to try it out in your own environment and share your thoughts—be it issues you face, features you'd love to see, or ideas for making it even better. Your feedback is super valuable in helping us improve the tools and create a better developer experience.</span><!---->\n        </p>\n    </div>\n  \n<!---->              ",
  "tags": []
}
